  "summary": "Postinstall beacon exfiltrates installer identity to hardcoded external host",
  "details": "The package's postinstall script (beacon.js) collects the installer's hostname, username, and current working directory via os.hostname(), os.userInfo().username, and process.cwd(), hex-encodes the concatenation, and sends it as a query string to the hardcoded remote endpoint https://exzotiqq.com/?syft-acp-util_<hex> using https.get(). This fires automatically on npm install with no user interaction, exfiltrating installer host identifiers to an attacker-controlled domain.",
